{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deceived Of Joy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001800/extras/cdb7e1faf7ec3b28e41065b5f78e027a.poster.avif?t=1767726035\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001800/extras/cdb7e1faf7ec3b28e41065b5f78e027a.webm?t=1767726035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001800/extras/cdb7e1faf7ec3b28e41065b5f78e027a.mp4?t=1767726035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When playing our game you undertake a very normal life living in a Hotel, you do tasks, listen to the radio and prepare for work. Slowly over time you might notice a few changes, cracks in the walls, sounds you've never heard before and a sense that maybe something unsettling is happening behind the scenes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001800/extras/18a054299d99c0c5874f3f6419eabab7.poster.avif?t=1767726035\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001800/extras/18a054299d99c0c5874f3f6419eabab7.webm?t=1767726035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001800/extras/18a054299d99c0c5874f3f6419eabab7.mp4?t=1767726035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take what's called &quot;The Miracle Pill&quot; a new pill that has gone global, a pill that erases doubt and depression. But after loosing your pills, the world around you starts to change. Almost like the pills have made you see things you weren't meant to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001800/extras/c6afc8276a37750c01ac8232ce6c74da.poster.avif?t=1767726035\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001800/extras/c6afc8276a37750c01ac8232ce6c74da.webm?t=1767726035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001800/extras/c6afc8276a37750c01ac8232ce6c74da.mp4?t=1767726035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll encounter creatures, you'll run for your life, experience world breaking illusions. Slowly loosing your mind not knowing what you'll see next. Using tools to progress, small puzzles to stump you and story telling to keep you hooked. Your goal after all is to survive and beat the nightmare you've lost your self in. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001800/extras/1989a0549a83664be83df607ce8e2478.poster.avif?t=1767726035\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001800/extras/1989a0549a83664be83df607ce8e2478.webm?t=1767726035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001800/extras/1989a0549a83664be83df607ce8e2478.mp4?t=1767726035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game includes extensive audio, atmospheric noises, characters, unique creatures, story telling, language and option setting support. Gameplay will vary between 1 - 2 hours, and the game includes save mechanics and subtitles. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- LevelBound Studios</h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Joy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001800/609238711bef6201bbbd3b73a21aca20dd6ee115.jpg"},{"name":"The Floating Eye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001800/848acce73e4510ec145ed27cf17784fb2bce28c8.jpg"},{"name":"Fall Through Your Shower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001800/15aff00d895418e3ac0a5a72d6b6ef1bb01fe9cd.jpg"},{"name":"Handle With Care","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001800/c6ba540234b145fb7870a0a1bb8884d49b05fab6.jpg"},{"name":"What a wonderful view","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001800/b39e0bb7d843759555a794d1b717e30fd2d12de2.jpg"},{"name":"Static Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001800/17c70fba0d8e0168926680e5ab98ed44e4879a98.jpg"},{"name":"Snap!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001800/01f5fe033facbe1d9397d63f9728a41ece823888.jpg"},{"name":"Feathered Intruder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001800/2c527d1f60e5164f09e345456c5f6066edd3d22b.jpg"},{"name":"Light the Way","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001800/43a5423946410b4fdaa91132a6e71be2fbe348bc.jpg"},{"name":"Eyes Where They Shouldn\u2019t Be","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4001800/23f6a86474a046a8e9bc0ae6e4b3a6ddafbc862d.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4001800?t=1767726035","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001800/5fcef2acfecd1f1c334879acfa3a385a75243635/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767726035","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001800/c7205d780901404b30b51c95307993da94dc4416/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767726035","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001800/c7205d780901404b30b51c95307993da94dc4416/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767726035","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains references to a fictional drug that alters perception of reality. The drug is not based on any real substance but is a narrative device that reveals hidden aspects of the game\u2019s world. Its use may be associated with unsettling or disturbing visual experiences."},"demos":[{"appid":4080360,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deceived Of Joy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001800/extras/cdb7e1faf7ec3b28e41065b5f78e027a.poster.avif?t=1767726035\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001800/extras/cdb7e1faf7ec3b28e41065b5f78e027a.webm?t=1767726035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001800/extras/cdb7e1faf7ec3b28e41065b5f78e027a.mp4?t=1767726035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When playing our game you undertake a very normal life living in a Hotel, you do tasks, listen to the radio and prepare for work. Slowly over time you might notice a few changes, cracks in the walls, sounds you've never heard before and a sense that maybe something unsettling is happening behind the scenes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop play